On available
    Say "Was this guy the tough one? This is too ... Anyways, I'm glad we got sealed. Shouldn't we complain to Bros of [Order of the Sorcery]? Hehe."

On offer
    Show quest "There's a strange movement of the devils. They have been quiet since the fall of [9 Devil] but I think they are upto something. No time to rest. Let's get down to the next devil.\n\n[Devil 8] Barbatos, also called Ace Hunter, is able to understand the voices of animals. It means that he's a natural-born hunter. As you can predict, something horrible will happen if he decides to hunt us . . . I don't even want to think about it. So, we have to get him before he gets us. Go to the [Luferson Castle] with the [Devil 8 Summoning Scroll], find the [Devil 8 Summoning Stone] at [Luferson Castle], and then, summon and destroy him.\n\nYou have to receive [Devil 8 Summoning Scroll] from [Order of the sorcery] Bros, of Ronark Land. Then, summon [Devil 8] Barbatos from [Devil 8 Summoning Stone] at Luferson Castle area and kill him. \n※ [Devil 8 Summoning Scroll] is free the first time, but from the next time on you'll have to pay a million Noahs."

On in_progress
    Say "The bowstring of [8Devil] Barbatos still sings on his hand. And that song is the requiem for the prey. Let's hurry."

On claimable
    Show quest "His bowstring is cut!\n\nHmm, there's a strange energy. I feel something is about to happen. Here's your next mission. Eliminate [31Devil] Foras and [55Devil] Orobas and bring their soul to me."
